# ENCORE – Portfolio Website

## About
ENCORE is a portfolio website for the Event Management Committee of the ENTC Department at Trinity Academy of Engineering. It showcases the committee's team members, events, activities, and contact information through a modern and responsive design.

## Features
- Modern dark-themed UI with purple accents
- About section
- Events showcase
- Team members portfolio
- Contact form
- Responsive layout

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## Project Structure
```text
ENCORE/
├── index.html
├── style.css
├── js/
│   └── script.js
└── Assets/
    └── imges/
```

## How to Run
1. Clone or download this repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Open `index.html` in your browser.

## Purpose
This project was created to present the ENCORE committee, its team, and its activities in a clean and professional portfolio format.

